  "name": "Cunning Step",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you use your Cunning Action class feature, you can also choose to teleport 30 ft to an unoccupied space that you can see. You can choose to do so immediately after or before applying the effect of Cunning Action. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>",
